;
1. Fixed Uiso
 At 1.2 times of:
  All C(H) groups, All C(H,H) groups, All N(H,H,H) groups
2. Uiso/Uaniso restraints and constraints
Uanis(Pb1) = Uanis(Pb1A) = Uanis(Pb1B)
Uanis(Pb2) = Uanis(Pb2A) = Uanis(Pb2B)
3. Others
 Sof(Br5B)=Sof(Br6B)=Sof(Br7B)=Sof(Br8B)=1-FVAR(1)
 Sof(Pb1A)=Sof(Pb2A)=Sof(Pb1B)=Sof(Pb2B)=0.5*(1-FVAR(2))
 Sof(Pb1)=Sof(Pb2)=Sof(Br5A)=Sof(Br6A)=Sof(Br7A)=Sof(Br8A)=FVAR(1)
4.a Secondary CH2 refined with riding coordinates:
 C1A(H1AD,H1AE), C2A(H2AA,H2AB), C1B(H1BA,H1BB), C2B(H2BA,H2BB), C1C(H1CA,
 H1CB), C2C(H2CA,H2CB), C1D(H1DC,H1DD), C2D(H2DA,H2DB)
